00:22:17.860 --> 00:22:20.630
"Yet"?! So then you DID intend to
pull something, didn't you?!

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:22.840
Augh! Stop it, Banpei!

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:24.170
Keiichi!

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:33.670
Woh, it starts to shine

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:50.460
The gentle wind I felt on my cheek

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:59.230
Was the start of the miracles you brought

00:22:59.910 --> 00:23:07.370
As though my everyday life until
then had never existed

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:12.990
My new happy life, completely repainted

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:16.390
In the colors of spring

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:21.330
Even waking up early, even traffic jams

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:25.730
Even heavy things to carry,
even sleepless nights

00:23:25.730 --> 00:23:30.070
Somehow I feel thankful for everything

00:23:30.070 --> 00:23:34.780
Let's create more and more of our miracles

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:42.610
Woh, whatever kind of morning

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:51.120
Woh, it starts to shine

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:54.620
Every day is a miracle

00:23:55.800 --> 00:23:58.630
A goddess who gives her heart and soul
for that special person:

00:23:58.630 --> 00:24:02.630
The image kindles the fire of a
certain queen's smoldering heart.

00:24:02.900 --> 00:24:04.700
Next time, "Ah! The Beleaguered
Queen of Vengeance!"

